# Copy to .env (gitignored). The omega config env cascade delivers these to
# manager runs and web builds.

# FontAwesome Pro without a token: point at a "Pro for Web" download dir
# (contains svgs/ + optionally metadata/). The icon chain is
# [env dir, pro npm, free] — see the omega monorepo's docs/shared/icons.md.
# OMEGA_FONTAWESOME_ROOT=/path/to/fontawesome-pro
